fit zložený.</p><div class="pf-o__main pf-d"><div class="pf-o__look"><img class="pf-o__img" alt=""><span class="pf-o__num"></span><div class="pf-o__spots"></div></div><div class="pf-o__info"><div class="pf-o__top"><div class="pf-o__head"><span class="pf-o__act"></span><h3 class="pf-o__title"></h3><p class="pf-o__text"></p></div><div class="pf-o__list"></div><button type="button" class="pf-btn pf-o__cta"><span data-i18n="buy_outfit">NAKÚPIŤ OUTFIT</span><span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button></div><div class="pf-o__thumbs pf-noscroll" role="group" data-i18n-aria="choose_outfit" aria-label="Vyber outfit"></div></div></div></div><div class="pf-m"><div class="pf-om pf-noscroll"></div><div class="pf-om__bar"><span class="pf-om__n">01</span><span class="pf-om__segs"></span><span class="pf-om__t"></span></div></div></section><section class="pf-sec pf-sec--a pf-mat"><div class="pf-wrap pf-d"><div class="pf-headrow"><h2 class="pf-h2" data-i18n="mat_h2">To najlepšie<br><span class="pf-red">zo sveta materiálov.</span></h2><div class="pf-mat__side"><p class="pf-p" data-i18n="mat_p"><strong>Navrhnuté pre výkon. Postavené na špičkových technológiách.</strong><br>V kolekcii PEAK FLOW používame prémiové materiály od svetových výrobcov.</p><a class="pf-link" data-cfg-href="materialsUrl" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span data-i18n="mat_all">SPOZNAŤ TECHNOLÓGIE</span><span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></div><div class="pf-mat__grid"></div></div><div class="pf-m"><div class="pf-marq" role="region" aria-label="Materiály Peak Flow"><div class="pf-marq__in"></div></div><div class="pf-gut"><a class="pf-link pf-link--s" data-cfg-href="materialsUrl" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span data-i18n="mat_about">SPOZNAŤ TECHNOLÓGIE</span> →</a></div></div></section><section class="pf-sec pf-sec--b"><div class="pf-wrap"><div class="pf-headrow"><div><h2 class="pf-h2" data-i18n="ter_h2">Výkon má<br><span class="pf-red">mnoho podôb.</span></h2><p class="pf-p pf-ter__p" data-i18n="ter_p"